    "note": "PageSizeReadinessInspector reads only the ELF header + program-header table (<= 64 KiB per entry, streamed) of every arm64-v8a / x86_64 / riscv64 library in a directly inspected APK or AAB, verifies PT_LOAD alignment >= 16 KB and, when the manifest declares extractNativeLibs=\"false\", the ZIP data offsets of stored libraries via the package's own central directory. Verdicts READY / NOT_READY / UNVERIFIED / NO_64BIT_LIBRARIES / NOT_EVALUATED (nested container APKs) are rendered in the native-library section, the host file-information summary and (NOT_READY) the findings section; 17 strings x 11 locales; PageSizeReadinessInspectorTest (11 tests) plus the existing archive / partition suites pass; ManifestSummary gained extractNativeLibs."
  },
